{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"交换Hopf代数"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"交换 Hopf 代数"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>交换 Hopf 代数是仿射群概形 ("},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":"范畴中的"},{"Local":{"url":"群","text":"群"}},{"Plain":") 的"},{"Local":{"url":"代数-几何对偶","text":"代数侧对偶"}},{"Plain":"概念, 可推广为"},{"Local":{"url":"交换Hopf代数胚","text":"交换 Hopf 代数胚"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>交换 Hopf 代数</strong>就是乘法交换的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Hopf代数","text":"Hopf 代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}